    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520290/extras/1ffcca2d5ec700dc2221939e0fd25e59.avif?t=1750870536\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520290/extras/2ee3dafc8ae942ae9e750ea333c18c79.poster.avif?t=1750870536\" width=480 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520290/extras/2ee3dafc8ae942ae9e750ea333c18c79.webm?t=1750870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520290/extras/2ee3dafc8ae942ae9e750ea333c18c79.mp4?t=1750870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spent years building the perfect Bara card collection, filled with the rarest and hottest characters\u2026 and now they're gone! Someone hid your precious deck around the house, and only you can find it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3D environments and search every corner\u2014your cards could be where you least expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through drawers, look behind furniture, and check even the most\u2026 intimate spots. Don\u2019t let a single card slip away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock sensual illustrations and reclaim every piece of this must-have collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a hidden object game packed with muscles, mystery, and temptation? Only true collectors can recover the full deck!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520290/extras/815389906135c62a2fa231b77fe03979.avif?t=1750870536\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
